@host = http://localhost:5119
@apiKey = gh_agent_key_0001

# =====================================================
# TRIAGE ENDPOINT — Agentic Structured Output
# =====================================================

### Triage — Realistic VPN issue
# The model acts as a triage agent: it decides which tools to call (KB search,
# ticket lookup), in what order, then produces a structured TriageResult JSON
# response with priority, category, summary, and recommended actions.

POST {{host}}/api/triage
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "message": "My VPN connection drops every 15 minutes and I can't access the shared drive. This started after the latest Windows update.",
  "customerId": "user-0001"
}

###

### Triage — Hardware issue
POST {{host}}/api/triage
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "message": "My laptop screen is flickering intermittently and the device runs very hot even when idle."
}

###